{"id":720,"name":"Eureka Seven AO","slug":"eureka_seven_ao","synopsis":"The story is set on Okinawa's isolated island of Iwado, which has seen a growing movement advocating a return to an autonomous government. Ao Fukai, a 12-year-old boy with a missing father, lives on the island with an old doctor named Toshio and is about to enter middle school. Ao's mother was taken away a decade ago by unknown individuals. Naru Arata, Ao's 12-year-old childhood friend and the story's heroine, lives with her father, older sister, and grandmother. She has a \"Yuta\" power awakened within her due to an incident when she was young. A mysterious entity called \"Secret\" suddenly appears and launches an attack on the Scub Coral lifeform on the island. Ao launches a certain military FP called \"Nirvash\" aboard a Japanese military transport in his fervent desire to protect the island. \n\n(Source: FUNimation) ","format":"TV","season":"SPRING","year":2012,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:43","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 01:48:15","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":12471},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":12471},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":6741},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":8854},{"site":"ANN","externalId":13902},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":4686},{"site":"HULU","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":1435,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/otnKt6IE4TxoiKvMrLbdGbejoVlxhuuqiFfqVE46.jpg"},{"id":1436,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/8TcnIlsr4wKCZQfSx1p9qJdYsR266UGWt7UhO9Rz.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":17,"name":"Bones","slug":"bones"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":558,"name":"Eureka Seven","slug":"eureka_seven"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":4698,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":1,"song":{"id":4698,"title":"Escape","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":5370,"version":1,"episodes":"2-13","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":4093,"basename":"EurekaSevenAO-OP1.webm","filename":"Eurek